        <updated>2025-10-24T07:40:04.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF145 supports CSS module scripts in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1720570" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1720570</a> - i.e. you can import a stylesheet as a module using <code class="notranslate">import</code> and the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/import/with" rel="nofollow">import attribute</a> <code class="notranslate">type</code> with value  <code class="notranslate">"css"</code></p>
<p dir="auto">The support is only in preview, and is disabled by default. This adds update to experimental features and to release note.</p>
